    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="381e3d73-ba74-5e4c-a3a1-901646220359" activityNameId="49413846-eb0a-5af1-9bd7-ab3360fc4927" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silencer for ventilator unit 1800 m3/h, modular, at plant, Device</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silencer for ventilator unit 1800 m3/h, modular, at plant, Device
Production of a silencer for a air handling unit with 1800 m3/h nominal air flow rate (at 2 m/s air speed in cross section of air filter or heat exchanger), total weight: 90 kg/Unit, including a frame construction, casing, silencer baffle with section length 900mm. The frame construction made of aluminium-profiles, casing made of hot-dip galvanized and powder coated steel sheets insulated with polyurethane foam, rock wool as sound-absorbing media.;
UUID: ea3924a5-5987-368e-a3bf-d1c789d6f663
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps and for heating the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for infrastructure of the production site included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for ventilation systems in commercial and public buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Process information from 2003 to 2012
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ea3924a5-5987-368e-a3bf-d1c789d6f663.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
